# Frontend build-time environment (Vite). Copy to frontend/.env if you need
# to point the built app at a standalone backend origin.
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE empty (default): the app uses same-origin paths, and the
# serving layer proxies API calls to the backend:
#   - Vite dev server  (:5173)  proxies to http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   - Vite preview     (:7860)  proxies to http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   - Nginx (Docker)            proxies to http://backend:8000
#
# For a fully separate deployment (e.g. backend on api.example.com), set:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com
# VITE_API_BASE=
